\\ macros.6502 - macros for any file.

\\ Start a table on the next page if it would cross into it: an indexed read across a page costs a
\\ cycle.
\\
\\ Inputs:
\\     size: the table's bytes
\\
\\ Outputs:
\\     P%: on to the next page, if need be

MACRO FITPAGE size
    IF (P% AND &FF)+size > &100
        ALIGN &100
    ENDIF
ENDMACRO
